        <mxCell id="GY5rQt0mupLKRKyiQYgY-27" edge="1" parent="1" source="GY5rQt0mupLKRKyiQYgY-28" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=0;exitY=0;exitDx=184;exitDy=72;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="GY5rQt0mupLKRKyiQYgY-14">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="GY5rQt0mupLKRKyiQYgY-28" parent="1" style="shape=callout;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;perimeter=calloutPerimeter;position2=0.77;" value="&lt;br&gt;1. &lt;strong data-end=&quot;213&quot; data-start=&quot;191&quot;&gt;User Query / Input&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;- The process begins when the &lt;strong data-end=&quot;267&quot; data-start=&quot;244&quot;&gt;user enters a query&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g., “Summarize this report” or “What is quantum entanglement?”).&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The system needs to retrieve &lt;strong data-end=&quot;391&quot; data-start=&quot;369&quot;&gt;relevant knowledge&lt;/strong&gt; before the LLM generates a response." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="174" width="184" x="3198" y="-233" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="GY5rQt0mupLKRKyiQYgY-29" parent="1" style="shape=callout;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;perimeter=calloutPerimeter;position2=1;base=32;size=31;position=0.78;" value="&lt;strong data-end=&quot;466&quot; data-start=&quot;444&quot;&gt;Document Ingestion :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;466&quot; data-start=&quot;444&quot;&gt;1.Knowledge sources (PDFs, text files, docs, websites, etc.) are provided as input.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;466&quot; data-start=&quot;444&quot;&gt;2.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;These documents are &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-end=&quot;604&quot; data-start=&quot;575&quot;&gt;split into smaller chunks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; (e.g., 500–1000 tokens each).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Why? → Because embeddings work better on shorter, coherent text segments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="183" width="282" x="3213" y="-7" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="GY5rQt0mupLKRKyiQYgY-30" parent="1" style="shape=callout;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;perimeter=calloutPerimeter;" value="&lt;strong data-end=&quot;466&quot; data-start=&quot;444&quot;&gt;2.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;These documents are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot; data-end=&quot;604&quot; data-start=&quot;575&quot;&gt;split into smaller chunks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;(e.g., 500–1000 tokens each).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Why? → Because embeddings work better on shorter, coherent text segments.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="119" width="203" x="3854" y="83" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="GY5rQt0mupLKRKyiQYgY-31" parent="1" style="shape=callout;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;perimeter=calloutPerimeter;size=48;position=0.21;position2=0;" value="The Vector DB contains all the embedded chunks&lt;ul data-end=&quot;1317&quot; data-start=&quot;1153&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;1317&quot; data-start=&quot;1205&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;1317&quot; data-start=&quot;1207&quot;&gt;It supports &lt;strong data-end=&quot;1240&quot; data-start=&quot;1219&quot;&gt;similarity search&lt;/strong&gt;: given a query embedding, it can find the most relevant stored embeddings.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="177" width="216" x="4884" y="302" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="GY5rQt0mupLKRKyiQYgY-32" parent="1" style="shape=callout;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;perimeter=calloutPerimeter;size=28;position=0.2;position2=0.4;" value="When a user asks a question, the system embeds the &lt;strong data-end=&quot;1425&quot; data-start=&quot;1416&quot;&gt;query&lt;/strong&gt; using the same embedding model." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="94" width="167" x="4326" y="-59" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="GY5rQt0mupLKRKyiQYgY-33" parent="1" style="shape=callout;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;perimeter=calloutPerimeter;size=26;position=0.12;position2=0.12;" value="&lt;li data-end=&quot;1556&quot; data-start=&quot;1460&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;1556&quot; data-start=&quot;1462&quot;&gt;A &lt;strong data-end=&quot;1485&quot; data-start=&quot;1464&quot;&gt;similarity search&lt;/strong&gt; is performed in the Vector DB to find the &lt;strong data-end=&quot;1553&quot; data-start=&quot;1528&quot;&gt;top-k relevant chunks.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;1556&quot; data-start=&quot;1460&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;1556&quot; data-start=&quot;1462&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Example: Query = “What is RAG?” → Database retrieves the most relevant document sections about RAG.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="139" width="251" x="4819" y="33" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="GY5rQt0mupLKRKyiQYgY-34" parent="1" style="shape=callout;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;perimeter=calloutPerimeter;size=30;position=0.2;base=24;position2=0.16;" value="&lt;li data-end=&quot;1803&quot; data-start=&quot;1699&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;1723&quot; data-start=&quot;1701&quot;&gt;The system combines:&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;The &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-end=&quot;1791&quot; data-start=&quot;1766&quot;&gt;retrieved text chunks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; (context)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;The &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-end=&quot;1755&quot; data-start=&quot;1732&quot;&gt;original user query&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;This forms a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-end=&quot;1829&quot; data-start=&quot;1819&quot;&gt;prompt&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; for the LLM.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="98.5" width="253" x="4830" y="-231" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="GY5rQt0mupLKRKyiQYgY-35" parent="1" style="shape=callout;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;perimeter=calloutPerimeter;" value="&lt;h3 data-end=&quot;2012&quot; data-start=&quot;1980&quot;&gt; &lt;strong data-end=&quot;2012&quot; data-start=&quot;1987&quot;&gt;Generator Model (LLM)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;2298&quot; data-start=&quot;2013&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;2120&quot; data-start=&quot;2013&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;2120&quot; data-start=&quot;2015&quot;&gt;A &lt;strong data-end=&quot;2041&quot; data-start=&quot;2017&quot;&gt;large language model&lt;/strong&gt; (like GPT, Gemini, LLaMA, Claude, or Groq) processes the constructed prompt.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;2120&quot; data-start=&quot;2013&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;2120&quot; data-start=&quot;2015&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;The LLM uses both:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;2233&quot; data-start=&quot;2121&quot;&gt;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;2233&quot; data-start=&quot;2146&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;2192&quot; data-start=&quot;2146&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;2192&quot; data-start=&quot;2148&quot;&gt;Its &lt;strong data-end=&quot;2174&quot; data-start=&quot;2152&quot;&gt;internal knowledge&lt;/strong&gt; (training data)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;2233&quot; data-start=&quot;2195&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;2233&quot; data-start=&quot;2197&quot;&gt;The &lt;strong data-end=&quot;2231&quot; data-start=&quot;2201&quot;&gt;retrieved external context&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;2298&quot; data-start=&quot;2234&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;2298&quot; data-start=&quot;2236&quot;&gt;It generates a &lt;strong data-end=&quot;2269&quot; data-start=&quot;2251&quot;&gt;final response&lt;/strong&gt; grounded in the documents.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="225" width="291" x="4002" y="-610" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="GY5rQt0mupLKRKyiQYgY-36" parent="1" style="shape=callout;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;perimeter=calloutPerimeter;" value="&lt;h3 data-end=&quot;2333&quot; data-start=&quot;2305&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;2333&quot; data-start=&quot;2312&quot;&gt;Response Delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;2485&quot; data-start=&quot;2334&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;2398&quot; data-start=&quot;2334&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;2398&quot; data-start=&quot;2336&quot;&gt;The generated response is sent back to the &lt;strong data-end=&quot;2395&quot; data-start=&quot;2379&quot;&gt;user display&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;2485&quot; data-start=&quot;2399&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;2485&quot; data-start=&quot;2401&quot;&gt;Optional: The system may also provide references or links to the retrieved chunks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="172" width="228" x="3441" y="-470" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
